{"id":"vod_hh_59214","vodId":"59214","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"机动奥特曼 第一季","name_cn":"机动奥特曼 第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/97652673df105b7ad2ba940585e53500.jpg"},"summary":"从前有位“光之巨人”，他负责保卫世界和平，对抗巨型怪物和外星人入侵的威胁。他就是机动奥特曼。他曾在执行任务时与科学考察队员早田进建立起联系，并在使命完成后离开了地球。时至今日，人类已进入了繁荣时代，但这只不过是和平的假象...现在，世界再次需要“光之巨人”的力量。就在这时，一个新的英雄出现了，他继承了光的基因。但是他并不高大，是一名中等身材、多愁善感的高中生，穿着金属动力制服。他的名字叫早田进次郎，是初代机动奥特曼早田进的儿子。早田进次郎克服种种困难成为新一代机动奥特曼，一个新的故事就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-14 12:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAoQQzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMgEE3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penXYYlb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQmNNYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelLvv6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6ymm9a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXw77md/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKBYYne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDrYYne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejMvv5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0p2AXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8Aoood/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4wkW6a/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:10.065Z"}